@Task_1_HostAddress = http://localhost:5260

### Get All Products V1
GET {{Task_1_HostAddress}}/v1/Product
Accept: application/json

### Get Product By Id V1
GET {{Task_1_HostAddress}}/v1/Product/1
Accept: application/json

### Get All Products V2
GET {{Task_1_HostAddress}}/v2/Product
Accept: application/json

### Get Product By Id V2
GET {{Task_1_HostAddress}}/v2/Product/1
Accept: application/json

### Create Product V2
POST {{Task_1_HostAddress}}/v2/Product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor",
  "price": 3500,
  "stock": 15,
  "description": "27 inch 4K monitor"
}

###
